Given the following statement:

    iAnswer := 12 + 4/2 * 2/(9 MOD 2);

The value of iAnswer will be …

State whether the following statement is valid or invalid:

    X := Y = 2;

where the data type of X is Boolean and Y is integer.

The following code was used to generate a random number in the range 1 to 10, excluding numbers 5 and 8:

    Repeat
        iNumber := RandomRange(1,11);
    Until (iNumber <> 5) AND (iNumber <> 8);

Rewrite the code using a WHILE loop.
